---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/Nav.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Global CGPA – CGPA to Percentage Calculator"
  description="Learn about Global CGPA – a free, student-built CGPA to percentage calculator with official university formulas, guides and conversion tools for Indian students."
  canonical="https://globalcgpa.in/about"
>
  <SiteHeader />

  <main class="max-w-[780px] mx-auto px-6 py-14" style="flex:1;">
    <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-500 mb-2">About Us</div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3">Built by students, for students.</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400 text-base mb-10 max-w-xl">
      Global CGPA started as a simple frustration — every CGPA calculator online was either covered in ads, required a login, or used the wrong formula for Indian universities.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 my-8">
      <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-xl p-5 text-center">
        <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-500 block">10+</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1 block">Converters</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-xl p-5 text-center">
        <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-500 block">7+</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1 block">Universities</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-xl p-5 text-center">
        <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-500 block">0</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1 block">Signups needed</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-xl p-5 text-center">
        <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-500 block">100%</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1 block">Free forever</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8">Our Story</h2>
      <p>
        Global CGPA was created to solve a common problem: needing to convert CGPA to percentage for job applications, and finding that every online tool either used the generic formula or was buried under pop-up ads.
      </p>
      <p>
        The solution was straightforward — build a single, clean, fast tool that supports every major university formula, works offline, and never asks for your personal data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8">What We Build</h2>
      <p>
        Global CGPA is a fast, clean client-side tool. Every calculation happens entirely in your browser.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
        <li>Your inputs never leave your device.</li>
        <li>The page loads instantly on any connection.</li>
        <li>Works offline once loaded.</li>
        <li>No account signup required.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8">How We Keep It Free</h2>
      <p>
        Running a website costs money, so the site is supported by a limited number of unobtrusive ads (Google AdSense). We deliberately keep ads away from the calculator inputs and results, and we never use pop-ups or full-screen interstitials that interrupt a conversion. See our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-emerald-500 underline">Privacy Policy</a> for details on what ad services may collect.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8">Accuracy First</h2>
      <p>
        Every university formula on this site is sourced from the university's own ordinance or circular, and each calculator page cites it. Universities do revise their rules — if you spot a formula that no longer matches your university's latest regulation, <a href="/contact" class="text-emerald-500 underline">tell us</a> and we'll fix it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>
